{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09613","headline":"出关经华岳寺访法华云公 · 岑参","name":"出关经华岳寺访法华云公","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"野寺聊解鞍，偶见法华僧。\n开门对西岳，石壁青棱层。\n竹径厚苍苔，松门盘紫藤。\n长廊列古画，高殿悬孤灯。\n五月山雨热，三峰火云蒸。\n侧闻樵人言，深谷犹积冰。\n久愿寻此山，至今嗟未能。\n谪官忽东走，王程苦相仍。\n欲去恋双树，何由穷一乘。\n月轮吐山郭，夜色空清澄。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"岑参","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09613.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09613","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}